{"items": [{"owner": {"account_id": 2248626, "reputation": 1580, "user_id": 1981397, "user_type": "registered", "accept_rate": 0, "profile_image": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/d8349b3129b4aad4cbebc9475d56520b?s=256&d=identicon&r=PG", "display_name": "Mike Malloy", "link": "https://stackoverflow.com/users/1981397/mike-malloy"}, "is_accepted": false, "score": 0, "last_activity_date": 1386095782, "creation_date": 1386095782, "answer_id": 20359008, "question_id": 20267853, "content_license": "CC BY-SA 3.0", "body": "<p>This bug has been fixed and will be included in the next release (R24.4).  If you still have any problems with the new release, please let us know.</p>\n"}, {"owner": {"account_id": 4409724, "reputation": 11, "user_id": 3593019, "user_type": "registered", "profile_image": "https://i.sstatic.net/E842Y.jpg?s=256", "display_name": "Kurt Kanaskie", "link": "https://stackoverflow.com/users/3593019/kurt-kanaskie"}, "is_accepted": false, "score": 0, "last_activity_date": 1419253720, "creation_date": 1419253720, "answer_id": 27603376, "question_id": 20267853, "content_license": "CC BY-SA 3.0", "body": "<p>I recently got a similar error in the most recent version of Apigee (Version 141029).</p>\n\n<p>The error: \"Fetch WSDL Error: Cannot invoke method startsWith() on null object\". </p>\n\n<p>The fix was to rename my local file from \"somename.xml\" to \"somename.wsdl\".</p>\n"}], "has_more": false, "quota_max": 300, "quota_remaining": 233}